  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Sandstone&amp;co\u00ae Projects 06 Services 06 Studio Since 2010 Contact Say hello Overview Buy Sandstone Latest project Harbour hotel lounge Porvoo, Finland Helsinki Fredrikinkatu 34 00100 Helsinki Mon to Fri, 9 to 18 +358 00 000 0000 [email protected] LinkedIn Instagram Behance We are a small interior studio in Helsinki, designing rooms that feel calm , work hard and age well . Sandstone&amp;co started in 2010 with one client, one apartment in Kallio and a borrowed drawing table. We still work from Helsinki, a few streets from where it began. We design homes, small hotels, caf\u00e9s and the occasional workplace, mostly across the Nordics, with a few houses in Italy and Spain. Since then we have finished 140 interiors and taken home a handful of awards, but we still take on only four projects at a time. Every project starts on site. We measure the rooms ourselves, sit in them at different times of day and decide what stays before we draw anything new. We work with a short list of joiners, upholsterers and stonemasons we trust, and we stay on site until the last shelf is hung. Three rules we bring to every room, from a studio flat to a hotel. 01. Keep what works Old floors, ",
